<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Hansom Holdings suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Hansom Holdings suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of construction concern Hansom Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Shares of Hansom Holdings ended HK$0.325 higher at HK$2.625 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
